<title>USA: ClinTrials down on brokerage comment - analysts.</title>
<headline>ClinTrials down on brokerage comment - analysts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of ClinTrials Research Inc dropped sharply Tuesday after brokerage firm Wessels, Arnold &amp; Henderson LLC downgraded the stock, analysts said.</p>
<p>Wessels declined to comment.</p>
<p>ClinTrials fell 6-1/4 to 17 and was one of the most active Nasdaq issues after Wessels cut its rating on the stock to hold from &quot;focus buy,&quot; analysts said.  </p>
<p>ClinTrials officials could not be reached for comment.</p>
</text>
